<Base title="Terms of use (draft) | Tessera" description="Licence terms for Tessera. Draft pending review." noindex>
  <Prose title="Terms of use" draft intro="An outline only. Licence terms, refunds, support, device allowances and update policy are business decisions that need the owner's approval and legal review.">
    <h2>Points to decide before launch</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The legal entity offering Tessera, and its contact address.</li>
      <li>Whether a Pro licence covers one person on several computers, and how many.</li>
      <li>Which updates a Pro purchase includes.</li>
      <li>Refund policy and support commitments.</li>
      <li>Governing law and jurisdiction.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What will not change</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Scanning, the storage map and the largest-files list remain free.</li>
      <li>A licence problem never blocks access to your own files.</li>
    </ul>
  </Prose>
</Base>
